<BaseLayout title="About - Stuff Seth Thinks Is Cool">
  <h2>About this site</h2>
  <p>This is a curated list of software-development links Seth finds interesting. Raindrop is the capture inbox; the GitHub repository is the durable publishing layer.</p>
  <p>Goose prepares concise notes in a casual colleague-to-colleague voice, with enough context to remember why a link seemed worth saving. Publication happens by pull-request review, so Seth stays in the loop before links go live.</p>
  <p>Source links belong to their original authors. This site is just a pointer, a short note, and a trail of what caught Seth's eye.</p>
</BaseLayout>
